eroine-type girl, cheat skill character. Loves everyone.\n\nBlack: noble daughter, commander girl. Loves conditionally. \n\nWhite: stoic genius mage. Cares more for self. Star magician.\n\nPink: chaotic bright miko. Cares more for others. Rainbow dancer.\n\nSilver:  overworked holy sister. Flawless qualities, terrible luck.\n\nPurple: 1st princess. A gentle but lonely girl. Queen of orchids.\n\nOrange: 2nd princess, Villainess type. Orange rose.\n\nNavy: royal maid, retainer, professional slacker.\n\nMaroon: professional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nBrown: cafe maid boss, coffee girl.\n\nOpal: music composer and theatre girl. Reckless type.\n\nTourmaline: traveler, collector, merchant.\n\nAnything is fine!\n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 764052, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "バンバンG", "screen_name": "BANBANJIIIIIII", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1901197775016247296/Wg31VTkQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1295225134236631041/1765908444/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "voice"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 2598039, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぼーち", "screen_name": "rkgktyo_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2005012826554073090/UUfMw9tx.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1226102178596540422/1762089095/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null,